WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.300
Keep on holding me

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.300
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:09.180
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:09.180
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:00:10.870 --> 00:00:22.000
If I reach out in the light, I can touch

00:00:10.870 --> 00:00:22.000
Hikari no naka ni te wo sashinobaseba todoku

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:27.190
The precious arms

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:27.190
Anna ni motomete ita kakegae no nai ude e

00:00:27.190 --> 00:00:32.190
I have been searching for so hard

00:00:27.190 --> 00:00:32.190
Anna ni motomete ita kakegae no nai ude e

00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:39.500
I turn around and the sky of blue

00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:39.500
Furimukeba kodoku ni wa

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:49.000
Smiles down upon my solitude

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:49.000
Sora ga aoku hohoende kureru

00:00:49.180 --> 00:00:56.250
In the darkness, I nearly lose sight of my dreams

00:00:49.180 --> 00:00:56.250
Kurayami ni yume wo miushinai sou ni naru

00:00:56.790 --> 00:01:04.150
But if you remain by my side

00:00:56.790 --> 00:01:04.150
Demo anata ga itekureru no nara

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:08.460
Keep on holding me

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:08.460
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:12.130
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:12.130
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:19.300
I want to protect this love for always

00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:19.300
Itsudemo kono omoi wo mamoritai no

00:01:19.570 --> 00:01:24.650
This love...

00:01:19.570 --> 00:01:24.650
Omoi wo

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:34.820
What... should I do?

00:01:36.160 --> 00:01:39.030
Where... should I go?

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:43.540
Kurau...

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:46.580
I'll protect you.

00:01:47.570 --> 00:01:50.500
Just like you protect me.

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:54.510
I want to protect you.

00:02:23.640 --> 00:02:27.750
Ten with serious or slight injuries
and one pod seriously damaged...

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:30.420
I can't believe the class-A
equipment didn't work...

00:02:30.980 --> 00:02:33.590
Who on Earth is this Kurau?

00:02:33.980 --> 00:02:36.760
Why was the AR System ineffective?

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:43.190
Inspector, have the research team analyze
and improve the system immediately!

00:02:43.190 --> 00:02:47.060
I know. I will talk to the research team myself.

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:47.930
Yes, sir.

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:52.560
The whereabouts of the girl living with
Kurau are still unknown.

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:55.100
Keep searching for those two.

00:02:55.370 --> 00:02:56.320
Roger.

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:14.090
A New Life

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:40.740
What on Earth was that?

00:03:53.490 --> 00:03:56.210
Hey, Hey, you're still glaring at me like that...

00:03:58.330 --> 00:04:00.420
You still can't trust me?

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:04.260
I'm grateful that you helped us escape this far.

00:04:06.070 --> 00:04:09.310
If you're upset about the bug I planted earlier, I apologize.

00:04:09.710 --> 00:04:13.770
But can you blame me for being suspicious after I find out that the person I'm guarding

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:15.770

is wanted by the GPO?

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:20.280
Even if I knew that it was a request from your father...

00:04:22.390 --> 00:04:25.780
Is it really a request from my father?

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:27.660
That's what I heard.

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:29.830
He said, "Protect my daughter."

00:04:30.630 --> 00:04:31.750
Daughter...

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:36.960
What else did my father say?

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:41.420
That's all I heard from the Broker.

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:45.300
I've tried to contact him directly,
but I couldn't get through.

00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:47.600
Apparently, he's not at home.

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:49.760
I see...

00:05:01.430 --> 00:05:03.400
Doug's not a bad guy.

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:08.030
He's Ted's father after all!

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:22.300
Ted's my son. That makes me a father, too.

00:05:22.950 --> 00:05:26.090
That's why I decided to take on this job.

00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:30.810
You don't have to believe me...

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:33.310
But, what can you do on your own?

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:47.660
Kurau!

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:51.580
Kurau...

00:05:54.050 --> 00:05:55.710
What should I do?

00:05:57.050 --> 00:05:58.790
Where should I go?

00:06:16.400 --> 00:06:18.470
There are fewer crabs now.

00:06:18.470 --> 00:06:21.040
You wanna move our fishing point further north?

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:22.230
Yeah, maybe...

00:06:26.950 --> 00:06:28.280
Chow time!

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:31.870
Yo!

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:37.370
Welcome!

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:39.000
Welcome...

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:44.640
This is “Umi-Suzume," right?

00:06:45.880 --> 00:06:48.920
A table for five? This way, please.

00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:50.890
Y-Yes!

00:07:05.450 --> 00:07:08.190
Come on, stop looking so grumpy.

00:07:08.190 --> 00:07:10.700
But... look at this outfit.

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:12.780
I think you look pretty good.

00:07:13.900 --> 00:07:18.330
I arranged for you to work as a live-in, so stop complaining.

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:22.880
Don't worry, I think you look pretty hot.

00:07:33.850 --> 00:07:35.600
You think it'll work out?

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:40.790
Yeah. I was looking for help, so this is a lifesaver.

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:43.460
Your wife's coming home from the hospital next week, right?

00:07:43.460 --> 00:07:44.610
You had a girl, right?

00:07:44.610 --> 00:07:48.440
Yeah, she looks just like me around the eyes.

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:49.610
You wanna see a picture?

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:53.240
I'll pass. Or I may be here forever.

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:58.080
I'm home!

00:07:58.540 --> 00:08:00.960
Welcome home, Yuuki. Good job.

00:08:00.960 --> 00:08:02.960
Was Mom doing okay?

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:04.330
Yeah...

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:05.630
And how about the baby?

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:08.460
Yeah...

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:16.490
Kurau, that's too much detergent!

00:08:16.490 --> 00:08:18.180
S-Sorry.

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:22.100
I take it Christmas was in charge of all the household chores?

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:23.770
Well, not really...

00:08:23.770 --> 00:08:26.170
So your name is Christmas?

00:08:26.170 --> 00:08:27.070
How old are you?

00:08:27.070 --> 00:08:30.400
She's cute. Where did you kidnap her from?

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:32.650
Hey, watch your mouth!

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:44.990
Klutz! Idiot!

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:46.580
Yuuki!

00:08:47.560 --> 00:08:48.920
Jeez...

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:53.160
Sorry about that, Kurau.

00:08:53.160 --> 00:08:55.760
Oh no, I should be the one to apologize.

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:58.100
Are you okay?

00:08:58.100 --> 00:08:59.640
Yeah...

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:02.350
What's Yuuki so upset about?

00:09:03.070 --> 00:09:05.570
He's been like that lately.

00:09:05.570 --> 00:09:08.400
I ask him what's wrong but he won't say anything.

00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:12.400
He's at a difficult age...

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:41.930
Is that all?

00:09:42.380 --> 00:09:43.770
Yeah...

00:09:46.050 --> 00:09:50.650
Awesome, Kurau. I've never seen anyone carry that many at once.

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:51.690
Really?

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:55.150
Yeah, we owe you one. Thanks.

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:59.990
It's nothing... I'm used to it with the kind of job I do.

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:03.040
The kind of job you do?
Are you a Battle Pod Pilot?

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:04.500
What? No...

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:06.870
You're not? That's a shame!

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:10.170
Yeah! You should take part in the Battle Pod league.

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:12.170
Huh? What do you mean?

00:10:12.590 --> 00:10:14.550
We have one on this island too.

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:16.790
Huh?

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:24.020
It certainly is popular.

00:10:24.020 --> 00:10:27.230
People travel from all over to watch this.

00:10:27.230 --> 00:10:31.980
It's not as much as the metropolis, but thanks
to this, this island is starting to prosper too.

00:10:38.490 --> 00:10:41.200
Push 'em, push 'em! Knock 'em down!

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:43.950
So how about it, Kurau? You wanna try it too?

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:45.170
Me?

00:10:45.170 --> 00:10:49.460
Yeah, I'm sure you'll go far with your skills. Try it.

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:57.670
If I feel like it.

00:11:13.170 --> 00:11:14.870
I'm...

00:11:22.940 --> 00:11:23.950
Yuuki?

00:11:34.720 --> 00:11:36.840
Stop following me, klutz!

00:11:37.530 --> 00:11:41.130
Can't help it. I'm going back to the restaurant, too.

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:48.060
Hey, what are you so mad about?

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:52.190
Are you always like this?

00:11:53.740 --> 00:11:54.860
Hey...

00:11:56.780 --> 00:12:00.190
Stop pouting or your face will stay like that.

00:12:00.190 --> 00:12:02.420
Shut up, you dog!

00:12:15.760 --> 00:12:17.210
I'm back.

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:20.930
Kurau! it's so awesome!

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:22.470
Hurry, come!

00:12:22.470 --> 00:12:23.970
H-Hang on.

00:12:33.580 --> 00:12:38.440
Kurau, let me introduce you.
This is my wife and my daughter.

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:46.830
She moved.

00:12:46.830 --> 00:12:49.620
That's amazing. She's looking this way!

00:12:50.060 --> 00:12:53.660
Well of course, she moves. She's alive, you know.

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:58.920
Wow... She smells so good...

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:09.680
Do you want to hold her?

00:13:20.390 --> 00:13:21.690
She's so warm.

00:13:39.150 --> 00:13:40.630
Here, Christmas.

00:13:44.850 --> 00:13:46.630
She's so small!

00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:52.220
She laughed! Did you see, Kurau? She laughed!

00:13:52.680 --> 00:13:54.310
That's awesome...

00:13:54.900 --> 00:13:55.930
This is so nice.

00:13:56.330 --> 00:13:58.230
I want a baby too.

00:14:09.380 --> 00:14:10.550
I'm home!

00:14:10.850 --> 00:14:12.280
Welcome home, Yuuki.

00:14:12.480 --> 00:14:13.580
Mom...

00:14:18.590 --> 00:14:21.630
Look, look, Yuuki! The baby's so cute!

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:23.500
No, she's not!

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:26.530
That thing's not cute at all!

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:30.800
Yuuki! Wait!

00:14:31.730 --> 00:14:32.890
Kurau!

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:47.860
Why'd you say such a thing?

00:14:49.420 --> 00:14:53.050
She's your baby sister. That wasn't very nice.

00:14:53.050 --> 00:14:55.090
What baby sister?

00:14:56.060 --> 00:14:58.540
I don't know of any baby sister...

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:02.290
Ever since she was born, everyone's been...

00:15:03.660 --> 00:15:07.880
No one wants me anymore...

00:15:11.540 --> 00:15:14.430
Don't say that.

00:15:19.110 --> 00:15:20.190
Yuuki...

00:15:23.550 --> 00:15:25.150
Dad...

00:15:40.800 --> 00:15:42.330
You can't sleep?

00:15:43.970 --> 00:15:45.370
Hey, Kurau...

00:15:45.370 --> 00:15:46.380
Yeah?

00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:48.760
Are you worried about something?

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:49.760
What?

00:15:53.950 --> 00:15:56.560
Do you like this island, Christmas?

00:15:56.560 --> 00:15:59.270
Yeah, I do.

00:15:59.270 --> 00:16:02.060
Really... I'm glad.

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:09.110
Kurau?

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:17.000
Prepping

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:30.720
The baby fell asleep.

00:16:30.720 --> 00:16:31.840
Yeah...

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:33.430
She's so cute, isn't she?

00:16:33.430 --> 00:16:34.470
Yeah...

00:16:35.160 --> 00:16:37.390
Kurau, I...

00:16:37.390 --> 00:16:38.390
Hmm?

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:41.100
Kurau, I'd like us to...

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:46.570
Oh no, she's up! What do we do?

00:16:46.570 --> 00:16:48.430
I don't know! What should we do?!

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:51.150
Maybe she's hungry. Or a dirty diaper?

00:16:52.910 --> 00:16:55.360
I'll go get her mom.

00:16:58.830 --> 00:16:59.870
Wait for me!

00:17:21.570 --> 00:17:24.170
There... There, there...

00:17:24.340 --> 00:17:27.610
There, there... There, there...

00:17:27.610 --> 00:17:30.690
There... There, there...

00:17:33.910 --> 00:17:35.950
Wow, that's an older brother for you.

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:39.910
I'm impressed. She stopped crying right away.

00:17:40.220 --> 00:17:42.540
She must know that you're her older brother.

00:17:43.420 --> 00:17:45.080
Older brother?

00:17:49.060 --> 00:17:52.210
Only you can be her older brother.

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:55.420
So you have to be with her, okay?

00:18:02.940 --> 00:18:05.010
She smiled... She smiled!

00:18:05.010 --> 00:18:07.190
She looked at me and smiled!

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:40.220
Oh, Teddy...

00:18:40.610 --> 00:18:44.720
it's nothing... I just wanted to hear your voice...

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:46.220
What are you up to?

00:18:54.630 --> 00:18:56.460
So this is Kurau?

00:18:56.460 --> 00:18:58.400
Yes, I see a resemblance.

00:18:58.400 --> 00:19:00.570
So she was alive!

00:19:00.570 --> 00:19:02.620
Does Dr. Amami know about this?

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:05.950
He insists that she's not his daughter.

00:19:06.770 --> 00:19:09.620
Did he think he could hide it forever?

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:16.960
This girl looks a lot like how Kurau looked ten years ago.

00:19:16.960 --> 00:19:19.380
Apparently, she recently
started living with Kurau.

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:21.800
But we haven't confirmed her identity.

00:19:23.990 --> 00:19:25.430
Is she her Pair?

00:19:26.010 --> 00:19:27.100
Pair?

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:30.160
She's her Pair! There's no doubt about it!

00:19:30.160 --> 00:19:33.870
How did she appear? What are her powers?

00:19:33.870 --> 00:19:37.110
So... you're saying that she's a Ryna sapien too?

00:19:37.110 --> 00:19:38.600
This is wonderful!

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:41.820
To be able to confirm the existence
of her Pair in this way!

00:19:42.110 --> 00:19:44.830
Does she have the same powers as Kurau?

00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:47.110
Or does she possess different powers?

00:19:47.110 --> 00:19:52.110
Information regarding Kurau is top secret
even among the GPO.

00:19:52.390 --> 00:19:54.130
Please keep it confidential.

00:19:54.840 --> 00:19:58.670
Even Dr. Amami does not know of this girl.

00:19:58.670 --> 00:20:00.470
She's her Pair...

00:20:00.470 --> 00:20:03.600
The Pair holds the key to solving
the mystery of Rynax.

00:20:03.600 --> 00:20:07.470
Inspector Wong, whatever it takes,
please capture these two girls!

00:20:07.470 --> 00:20:09.390
Especially this girl!

00:20:22.030 --> 00:20:23.240
You know...
You know...

00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:33.960
Hey, Kurau?

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:34.830
What?

00:20:36.170 --> 00:20:39.340
You'll always be here, won't you?

00:20:45.170 --> 00:20:48.930
Yeah... I'll always be by your side.

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:05.410
There's no doubt. That weapon was made to capture the two of us.

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:09.620
The only one who can make
such a thing... is Father.

00:21:10.160 --> 00:21:12.610
But, why?

00:21:14.200 --> 00:21:15.920
Also, when that happened...

00:21:16.330 --> 00:21:19.920
Christmas had the same powers as me.

00:21:21.170 --> 00:21:23.300
Welcome...

00:21:39.860 --> 00:21:46.840
From a great distance

00:21:39.860 --> 00:21:46.840
Tooku haruka kanata kara

00:21:49.210 --> 00:21:56.180
You smile at me

00:21:49.210 --> 00:21:56.180
Kimi ga hohoemu you ni

00:21:58.350 --> 00:22:05.320
The hopelessness that lingers from the past

00:21:58.350 --> 00:22:05.320
Kako kara tsuzuku hakanasa

00:22:07.420 --> 00:22:14.400
Is depicted in silence

00:22:07.420 --> 00:22:14.400
Shizuka ni utsushi dasarete

00:22:16.670 --> 00:22:23.640
Moonlight, please never change

00:22:16.670 --> 00:22:23.640
Moonlight kawarazu ni ite

00:22:25.780 --> 00:22:32.750
Moonlight, I'll come to see you

00:22:25.780 --> 00:22:32.750
Moonlight ai ni yuku Kimi ni

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:41.890
Moonlight, I'll come running up and surely

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:41.890
Moonlight kakenobori kitto

00:22:44.030 --> 00:22:51.000
Moonlight, we'll be able to meet again

00:22:44.030 --> 00:22:51.000
Moonlight mou ichido aeru

00:22:53.240 --> 00:23:00.210
Moonlight

00:22:53.240 --> 00:23:00.210
Moonlight

00:23:09.950 --> 00:23:11.950
Next Episode

00:23:11.950 --> 00:23:13.780
You can see the snow from inside.

00:23:13.780 --> 00:23:18.000
No, I want to see our house shining in the snow.

00:23:18.000 --> 00:23:19.460
It's going to be cold, you know.

00:23:19.460 --> 00:23:22.000
I'm okay. I know just the place.

00:23:22.000 --> 00:23:24.960
Another Christmas
